 36AL2cL average of T{-1/2}=6.6 ms {I11} from ion-|b-1408|g, and T{-1/2}=6.5 ms 
 36AL3cL {I10} from ion-|b-1109|g correlated decay curves (2023Lu07).           
 36AL  L 657+X          (1+)                                                    
 36AL cL J$From shell-model calculations (2023Lu07).                            
 36AL2cL Also possible Gamow-Teller |b transition from 0+ parent.               
 36AL  G 657                                                                    
 36AL cG $2023Lu07 mention that some contributions from                         
 36AL2cG a |g transition in {+34}Al (possibly through the |b{+-}2n decay of     
 36AL3cG {+36}Mg decay) can not be completely ruled out. A similar energy       
 36AL4cG transition has previously been reported in Coulomb excitation of       
 36AL5cG {+34}Al (2001Pr08: Phys. Rev. C 63, 047308)                            
                                                                                
